</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">2 4</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\"><u segoe=\"\" ui\",=\"\" roboto,=\"\" \"helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" arial,=\"\" \"noto=\"\" sans\",=\"\" sans-serif,=\"\" \"apple=\"\" color=\"\" emoji\",=\"\" \"segoe=\"\" ui=\"\" symbol\",=\"\" emoji\";=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 16px;=\"\" white-space:=\"\" normal;\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Test Output (</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">Red Text - User Input</span></u><span segoe=\"\" ui\",=\"\" roboto,=\"\" \"helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" arial,=\"\" \"noto=\"\" sans\",=\"\" sans-serif,=\"\" \"apple=\"\" color=\"\" emoji\",=\"\" \"segoe=\"\" ui=\"\" symbol\",=\"\" emoji\";\"=\"\"><font face=\"Arial\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"><u>)\n</u></span></font></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-style: italic; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">Test your program with the examples below\nNote that your list of random values may differ\n</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-style: italic; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">Example 1</span><span style=\"text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">\nInput row size and column size: </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">4 3</span><span style=\"text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">\n9 7 2\n2 0 1\n3 5 7\n4 4 6\nAfter increasing by 1\n0 8 3\n3 1 2\n4 6 8\n5 5 7\n</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-style: italic; text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">Example 2</span><span style=\"text-decoration-skip-ink: none;\">\nInput row size and column size: </span>